# rhwp fallback-glyph fixes for why-hwp, measured against Hangul 2024 output.
# Base: rhwp 7213ed1f9 after the source edits in wasm/patch-rhwp.sh,
# wasm/patches/rhwp-layout.patch and wasm/patches/rhwp-layout2.patch; apply this
# after rhwp-layout2.patch.
# Zero-context diff (apply with git apply --unidiff-zero).
#
# - equation/hancom_glyphs.rs, pdf.rs: when the PDF font database has no HyhwpEQ
#   or HancomEQN, equation private-use glyphs of that face are drawn as the
#   characters they stand for in the default equation fonts.
# - pua_glyph.rs, svg.rs, svg/pua_glyph.rs: a Wingdings private-use character
#   (U+F020-U+F0FF) that the run's face lacks is drawn as itself in Wingdings
#   when a Wingdings font is found and its cmap has the glyph; otherwise the
#   Unicode display substitute is kept.
# - pdf.rs, pua_glyph.rs and svg/tests.rs cover these changes.
